Package: sentinel-watchdog
Version: @@DEB_VERSION@@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aibel Bin Zacariah <aibelbinzacariah@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), cron
Replaces: sentinel-agent
Conflicts: sentinel-agent
Homepage: https://github.com/aibelbin/Sentinel
Description: Sentinel device inventory watchdog
 Reports installed software, host details and system resources to a Sentinel
 server, and applies watchdog updates the server publishes.
 .
 The watchdog is Python standard library only and runs unprivileged from a cron
 entry. Declaring python3 and cron here is the whole reason this package
 exists: apt resolves them, so no machine has to be prepared by hand.
 .
 Installing this package does not enrol the machine. Run
 "sentinel-watchdog enroll --server URL --key KEY" afterwards with the key issued
 for that device.
